    "text": "kpic\nwebsite\nCoos County, Oregon\nFire danger level rises to high in Coos County, public use restrictions now in effect\nBy Dan Kelly & KCBY.com Staff,\n1 days agoCOOS BAY, Ore. — The fire danger level in Coos County has increased from ‘Moderate’ to ‘High’ due to warm temperatures and high winds. Amber Cook, a spokesperson for Coos Forest Protective Association, says the most important thing to be aware of is Public Use Restrictions.\n5",
